ts a part of the scene. You decide the order, and Hannah moves forward alone, facing a world broken by memories, abandonment... and the search for a lost doll.\n\nControl the tape with your own hands in an immersive environment that simulates a forgotten room.\n\nWith a retro aesthetic, immersive music, and an emotionally charged design, Hannah VCR is a thrilling experience filled with mystery and the things that never fully heal.\n\nRewind. Change the order. Maybe this time, you'll manage to save her.\"", "short_description": "Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to alter environments and guide Hannah on her quest. Play in VR or with traditional controllers and explore a story filled with mystery, nostalgia, and broken memories."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1P9SFFi5tmdd5iZp5pDuhXiX5WIac7sjq/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/11z5LNoyRtxcXU0NMGFJcC45xveqSY0Yb/view?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "Spaceboy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spaceboy.studio/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9722768791153740"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1349103300510071"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "144814719371975